est?\nSelect one:\nA. That the patient’s lifestyle will change forever.\nB. That there is more than one way to treat the patient.\nC. That the patient needs dialysis for the rest of their life.", "sourcePage": 221, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "You hear a physiotherapist in a hospital talking with John, a new\npatient.\nThe physiotherapist is\nSelect one:\nA. providing sports recovery options.\nB. explaining why warm showers are beneficial.\nC. giving instructions to assist with recovery from an injury.", "sourcePage": 221, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "You hear a specialist physician and a nurse discussing a patient’s\ntreatment.\nThe nurse is unable to help the physician because\nSelect one:\nA. she isn't senior enough\nB. she isn't familiar with the patient.\nC. she doesn't understand the treatment options.", "sourcePage": 221, "choices": ["A", 